# Architecture

- Layers: `app` routes → feature components → hooks/utils/constants
- Shared chrome: Header, Footer
- Home, About, and Shelter Cam (`/porch`). Shelter Cam fetches the porch API in the browser. CloudFront signed-cookie access via `proxy/` for the test CDN
- Keep the product surface to those routes — no Cognito/SWR/admin without product approval
- See `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`
